          <msContents>
            <summary>[p][u]Contents[/u][/p]

[p]1. ff. 1v-19v Hieronymus de Manfredis, [i]Centiloquium de medicis et infirmis[/i][/p]

[p]Title: 'Jeronimi Manfredi clarisimi physici ac medici astrologi centiloquium medicine infirmis ad M. Johannem Bentinolium Hanibalis presilium'. [/p]

[p]Incipit: 'Quamuis Medicina de se scientia sit prefecta...'[/p]

[p]Explicit: '...fuge horas saturni et martis et elige horas Iouis et veneris'.[/p]

[p]2. ff. 20r-25v Notes on the zodiac, on the Alphabet, on times to take medicines accordingto the planets, on different kinds of medicines, on blood-letting and when, on the compounding of remedies, etc.[/p]

[p]3. ff. 21-30 blank[/p]</summary>
